00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.770
The first breakthrough is that

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:15.990
native spreadsheets are now powerful enough to do interactive simulation.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:21.635
a lot of our

00:09:21.635 --> 00:09:24.865
audience here, is familiar with Monte Carlo simulation.

00:09:24.865 --> 00:09:30.865
And I'll bet you're not aware that Native Excel can do it without any Macros or Add-ins,

