00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:20.390
In Native Excel, using something called the Data Table.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:26.375
Data, what if analysis data table,

00:11:26.375 --> 00:11:29.450
and I'm sure that at least two or three percent of the audience is

