00:53:24.620 --> 00:53:29.215
I'd like to be able to have a distribution of how long that concrete will take to set up.

00:53:29.215 --> 00:53:31.905
And I'd like to find

00:53:31.905 --> 00:53:35.720
build libraries like this and then be able to assemble them into bigger projects.

