00:53:51.255 --> 00:53:52.880
How would the clear communication,

00:53:52.880 --> 00:53:55.400
statistical ideas be incorporated into the class?

00:53:55.400 --> 00:54:00.845
Well as I mentioned,

00:54:00.845 --> 00:54:05.090
I like to have

00:54:05.090 --> 00:54:08.515
explanations that a 10-year-old will understand.

00:54:08.515 --> 00:54:11.105
My motto is

00:54:11.105 --> 00:54:13.145
this stuff is easy to explain.

00:54:13.145 --> 00:54:16.405
The hard part is getting anyone to understand it.

00:54:16.405 --> 00:54:18.170
And, at the end of the class,

00:54:18.170 --> 00:54:19.900
there are going to be class presentations.

00:54:19.900 --> 00:54:21.625
So, we're not gonna have a final.

00:54:21.625 --> 00:54:24.325
We're gonna have a class project, right?

00:54:24.325 --> 00:54:29.700
And the class project requires you to get up there and not explain it,

00:54:29.700 --> 00:54:31.455
you don't get any points for explaining it.

00:54:31.455 --> 00:54:34.920
You get points for getting people to understand what you're doing.

00:54:34.920 --> 00:54:39.110
And so, I will encourage class participation and

00:54:39.110 --> 00:54:43.445
learning how to,

00:54:43.445 --> 00:54:46.620
how to explain things clearly

00:54:46.620 --> 00:54:50.550
ends up being probably way more important than even getting the analysis right,

00:54:50.550 --> 00:54:52.880
or you can't get- I don't think you can

00:54:52.880 --> 00:54:55.040
get the analysis right if you can't explain it clearly.

00:54:55.040 --> 00:54:56.815
They're just too intimately tied up.

00:54:56.815 --> 00:54:59.290
And people don't

00:54:59.290 --> 00:55:02.010
spend nearly as much time on the communication aspect.

00:55:02.010 --> 00:55:03.260
So, for me, you know,

00:55:03.260 --> 00:55:06.100
I think of myself as basically a public relations guy.

00:55:06.100 --> 00:55:07.780
this Jensen's Inequality has been

00:55:07.780 --> 00:55:09.880
around for over 100 years, and no one knows about it.

00:55:09.880 --> 00:55:15.295
So, Jensen's inequality is my anchor tenant and of course,

00:55:15.295 --> 00:55:24.520
the flaw of averages is the word I gave it to try to get people to understand it.

00:55:24.520 --> 00:55:25.760
And we only have

00:55:25.760 --> 00:55:28.145
